| `src/store/kanban.js` | Modify | action `removeSprintColumn` | Removes a column (guards last column) and migrates its tasks to a remaining column. |
| `src/store/kanban.js` | Modify | `exportBoard` / `importBoard` | Round-trip the sprint column `value` so customized sprint boards survive transfer. |
| `src/components/kanban/board/SprintBoardModals.vue` | Modify | column dialog | Column dialog is id-based (`newColumn.id`), supports an optional explicit column arg, and shows a Delete action gated by `allowColumnDelete`. |
| `src/components/kanban/board/SprintBoardModals.vue` | Modify | `newTaskStatus`, sprint info copy | New-task column label resolves from the board columns; the sprint board-type hint reflects that columns are editable. |
| `src/components/kanban/board/SprintBoardView.vue` | Modify | header + canvas + modals | Adds a "New column" button, enables `allowNewColumn`/`allowEditColumn` on the canvas, passes `columns`/`allowColumnDelete` to the modals and wires `column-created`/`column-updated`/`column-deleted`. |

